u and your horses, either in the open air or in riding arenas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want, you can even go swimming with your horse.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just explore the environment or help the inhabitants with their tasks, it will certainly be worthwhile.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let yourself be helped by exploring the world of different pets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No loading time unless you reload the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have always dreamed of having your own riding stable and almost infinite freedom with your horses, take the opportunity and start your personal horse adventure right now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783860/extras/0e91162a3eb7a0911b82ad3683911db2.poster.avif?t=1770842263\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783860/extras/0e91162a3eb7a0911b82ad3683911db2.webm?t=1770842263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783860/extras/0e91162a3eb7a0911b82ad3683911db2.mp4?t=1770842263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783860/extras/06a38427c208111589ab254193212432.poster.avif?t=1770842263\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/783860/extras/06a38427c208111589ab254193212432.webm?t=1770842263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://sh